~~~~~$  [[☃ explanation 3]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 3":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"Here's how we multiplied the fractions:\n\n$\\phantom{=}60 \\cdot \\dfrac2{5}$\n\n$ =\\dfrac{60 \\cdot 2}{5}$\n\n$=\\dfrac{120}{5}$","hidePrompt":"Hide explanation","showPrompt":"Explain","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"$ =24 ~\\text{ dollars per liter} ~~~~~~~~$  [[☃ explanation 4]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 4":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\dfrac{120}{5}$ is the same as $120 \\div 5$, which is $24$.","hidePrompt":"Hide explanation","showPrompt":"Explain","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"The cost per liter of paint was $\\$24$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"question":{"content":"Corey bought $2\\dfrac12$ liters of paint for $\\$60$.  \n\n**What was the cost per liter of paint?**  \n*Enter an exact answer, without rounding.*\n\n$\\$$ [[☃ numeric-input 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"numeric-input 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answers":[{"maxError":null,"message":"","simplify":"required","status":"correct","strict":false,"value":24}],"coefficient":false,"labelText":"","multipleNumberInput":false,"size":"normal","static":false},"static":false,"type":"numeric-input","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
